error[L0517]: a returned closure cannot use `t`, which `bump-ref!` changes
 --> check/returned_closure_uses_written_mut_parameter.knv:3:17
  |
3 |   (fn () (deref t)))
  |                 ^ the closure uses `t` here
  |
  = note: `t` borrows the caller's value as `mut`, and the closure would keep that borrow for as long as it lives
  = help: copy it first with `(local value (deref t))` and use `value` in the closure

error[L0517]: a returned closure cannot use `items`, which `counter!` changes
 --> check/returned_closure_uses_written_mut_parameter.knv:7:15
  |
7 |   (fn () (len items)))
  |               ^^^^^ the closure uses `items` here
  |
  = note: `items` borrows the caller's value as `mut`, and the closure would keep that borrow for as long as it lives
  = help: copy it first with `(local value (clone items))` and use `value` in the closure
